    <tr style="border: 1px dashed #333;">
        <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px dashed #333;"><b>Grade:</b> 2nd Grade (CEFR: Pre-A1.4)</td>
        <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px dashed #333;"><b>Scenario:</b> All About My Body</td>
        <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px dashed #333;"><b>Theme:</b> Hats and Shoes!</td>
    </tr>
    <tr style="border: 1px dashed #333;">
        <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px dashed #333;"><b>Date(s):</b> From ___ to ___</td>
